  "title": "Creamy Banana Pudding",
  "description": "No-cook creamy banana pudding made with heavy cream, instant vanilla pudding, and condensed milk — and, of course, bananas and vanilla wafer cookies!",
  "authors": [
    "Barbara Milam"
  ],
